{
  "name": "OI · Informe mensual de velocidad y SEO",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "name": "Día 1 de cada mes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 8 1 * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "oi-0069",
      "position": [
        260,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Clientes con mantenimiento",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "ID_DE_TU_HOJA",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gid=0",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Google Sheets (gratis)"
        }
      },
      "id": "oi-0070",
      "position": [
        500,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Cliente a cliente",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "oi-0071",
      "position": [
        740,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "PageSpeed móvil",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://www.googleapis.com/pagespeedonline/v5/runPagespeed?url={{ encodeURIComponent($json.url) }}&strategy=mobile&category=performance&category=seo",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "oi-0072",
      "position": [
        980,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Extraer métricas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const c = $('Cliente a cliente').first().json;\nconst l = $json.lighthouseResult ?? {};\nconst a = l.audits ?? {};\nreturn [{ json: {\n  cliente: c.cliente, email: c.email, url: c.url,\n  rendimiento: Math.round((l.categories?.performance?.score ?? 0) * 100),\n  seo: Math.round((l.categories?.seo?.score ?? 0) * 100),\n  lcp: a['largest-contentful-paint']?.displayValue ?? '—',\n  cls: a['cumulative-layout-shift']?.displayValue ?? '—',\n  mes: new Date().toLocaleDateString('es-ES', { month: 'long', year: 'numeric' })\n}}];"
      },
      "id": "oi-0073",
      "position": [
        1220,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Redactar el informe",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "parameters": {
        "url": "http://localhost:11434/api/generate",
        "options": {},
        "method": "POST",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"model\": \"llama3.1:8b\",\n  \"stream\": false,\n  \"prompt\": \"={{ `Escribe en español, tuteando y sin tecnicismos, un resumen de 4 frases para el dueño de un negocio local sobre el estado de su web este mes. Rendimiento {{ $json.rendimiento }}/100, SEO {{ $json.seo }}/100, LCP {{ $json.lcp }}, CLS {{ $json.cls }}. Termina con una recomendación concreta. No uses viñetas.` }}\"\n}"
      },
      "id": "oi-0074",
      "position": [
        260,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Montar el correo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const m = $('Extraer métricas').first().json;\nreturn [{ json: { ...m, texto: ($json.response ?? '').trim() } }];"
      },
      "id": "oi-0075",
      "position": [
        500,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Enviar al cliente",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "hola@oistudio.eus",
        "toEmail": "={{ $json.email }}",
        "subject": "=Tu web en {{ $json.mes }}: {{ $json.rendimiento }}/100 de velocidad",
        "emailFormat": "html",
        "html": "=<p>Hola {{ $json.cliente }}:</p><p>{{ $json.texto }}</p><table cellpadding=\"6\"><tr><td>Velocidad</td><td><strong>{{ $json.rendimiento }}/100</strong></td></tr><tr><td>SEO técnico</td><td><strong>{{ $json.seo }}/100</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Carga principal</td><td>{{ $json.lcp }}</td></tr></table><p>OI Studio · mantenimiento mensual</p>",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Gmail SMTP (gratis)"
        }
      },
      "id": "oi-0076",
      "position": [
        740,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Guardar histórico",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "ID_DE_TU_HOJA",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gid=0",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "options": {},
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {}
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Google Sheets (gratis)"
        }
      },
      "id": "oi-0077",
      "position": [
        980,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "oi-0078",
      "name": "Ficha",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -140,
        180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 360,
        "height": 320,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 📊 Informe mensual de velocidad y SEO\n**auto-informe-seo**\n\nPasa PageSpeed a cada web de cliente, guarda el histórico y manda un informe redactado en cristiano por la IA local.\n\n**Disparador:** Programado · día 1 de cada mes a las 8:00\n\n**Coste: 0 €** — n8n autoalojado · PageSpeed Insights API · Ollama en local · Google Sheets · Gmail SMTP\n\n- Consulta PageSpeed móvil de cada web (API pública y gratuita)\n- Extrae LCP, CLS y la puntuación de rendimiento\n- Ollama redacta el resumen en lenguaje de cliente, sin tecnicismos\n- Envía el informe y guarda la fila en el histórico"
      }
    }
  ],
